---
// Generated from design/source/Terms.dc.html by scripts/convert-legal.mjs. Do not reword by hand.
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { company } from '../config/site';
import '../styles/legal.css';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of use, Sparkwing"
  description="The terms for using the Sparkwing website."
>
  <section class="sw-legal-head" aria-labelledby="tm-title">
      <div class="sw-legal-inner">
        <h1 id="tm-title">Terms of use</h1>
        <p class="sw-legal-updated">Last updated 5 November 2026</p>
        <p class="sw-legal-lead">These terms apply when you use the website of {company.legalName} (ABN {company.abn}), based in Sydney, Australia. By using our website, you agree to them. If you don't agree, please don't use it.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sw-legal-body" aria-label="Terms details">
      <div class="sw-legal-inner">

        <div class="sw-legal-block">
          <h2>Using our website</h2>
          <p>Please use our website lawfully. Don't try to break into it, disrupt it, overload it, spread malware through it, or pretend to be someone else.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sw-legal-block">
          <h2>General information only</h2>
          <p>Our website gives general information about Sparkwing and our services. It isn't legal, tax, accounting or financial advice, so please get your own advice for your situation.</p>
          <p>We work to keep our website accurate and up to date. Some apps and features are in pilot or coming soon, and their features, prices and timing may change.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sw-legal-block">
          <h2>Our services</h2>
          <p>Our paid services are covered by a separate written agreement. Nothing on this website is a binding offer, and a quote only becomes binding when we both sign an agreement. If that agreement and these terms disagree, the agreement applies.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sw-legal-block">
          <h2>AI-generated content</h2>
          <p>AI can make mistakes. Please review any AI-generated content from our apps before you rely on it.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sw-legal-block">
          <h2>Our content</h2>
          <p>Sparkwing or our licensors own the content on this website, including its text, designs, logos and product names. You can view it, share links to it and print pages for your own business use. Please ask us before you copy, sell or republish it.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sw-legal-block">
          <h2>What you send us</h2>
          <p>When you send us ideas or feedback, we can use them to improve our services, and we don't owe you anything for that. Please don't send us anything you don't have the right to share. Our <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a> explains how we handle personal information.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sw-legal-block">
          <h2>Other websites</h2>
          <p>We may link to websites run by other people. We don't control those websites and aren't responsible for their content or how they handle your information.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sw-legal-block">
          <h2>Availability</h2>
          <p>We may update, pause or remove any part of our website at any time, and we can't promise it will always be available or free of errors.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sw-legal-block">
          <h2>Your consumer rights</h2>
          <p>Nothing in these terms removes rights you have under the Australian Consumer Law, or under any other consumer law that can't be excluded. That includes the consumer guarantees that apply to goods and services.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sw-legal-block">
          <h2>Limits on our liability</h2>
          <p>Our website is free to use. To the extent the law allows, we aren't liable for loss that comes from using it or relying on its general information. This doesn't limit any liability the law doesn't allow us to limit, including for fraud.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sw-legal-block">
          <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
          <p>We may update these terms and will post the new version here with a new date. Changes apply to your use of the website after we post them.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sw-legal-block">
          <h2>Governing law</h2>
          <p>These terms are governed by the laws of New South Wales, Australia, and the courts of New South Wales can hear any dispute about them. This doesn't remove any right you have to use the courts or regulators where you live, if the law gives you that right.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sw-legal-block">
          <h2>Contact us</h2>
          <p>For any question about these terms, email <a href="mailto:info@sparkwing.com.au">info@sparkwing.com.au</a>.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>
